<title>BELGIUM: GRENADE FOUND IN BELGIAN NATIONAL BANK CANTEEN.</title>
<headline>GRENADE FOUND IN BELGIAN NATIONAL BANK CANTEEN.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A grenade was found in the canteen of the Belgian National Bank (BNB) on Thursday, sparking a bomb alert.</p>
<p>A BNB spokesman said Belgian police were called to disable and remove the grenade. He said the bank did not know how the grenade got into the canteen, which is not open to the public.</p>
<p>A police spokesman was not immediately available to provide details.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
